Motive-*.png (tip-of-the-day pictures) and Smiley-Cry-128x128.png are rendered from the Noto Color Emoji
font, Copyright Google Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Scidb-Logo-128.png is the Chesswiz icon (icons/chesswiz.svg): the knight is by
Colin M. L. Burnett (GPL-2+ / BSD / GFDL), the composition is GPL-2+.

Rebuilding the tip-of-the-day pictures:
  python3 scripts/generate-motives.py [path/to/NotoColorEmoji.ttf]
All 29 Motive images are mapped explicitly to Unicode glyphs in that script.
The default font is /usr/share/fonts/truetype/noto/NotoColorEmoji.ttf,
from Ubuntu/Debian fonts-noto-color-emoji 2.051-1build1.
SHA256: 9fd0a3d0ce84d77e3185dfbae77bd1abf3926aa49a032e354d076c4f17151f10
Rendering: Pillow 12.2.0, 109 px bitmap strike, centred on transparent 180x180
canvas, Lanczos resized to each original image size.

Noto image resources are Apache-2.0; the font container is SIL OFL-1.1.
Upstream licence documentation:
https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji#license
Apache licence text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
Font licence: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji/blob/main/LICENSE
Copyright 2013-2017 Google Inc. and Arjen Nienhuis.
The font is a development dependency and is not redistributed here.

Contact sheets for all three asset groups:
  python3 scripts/generate-contact-sheets.py
Outputs: tests/tmp-app/assets/{textures,flags,motives}-contact-sheet.png
